This repository makes the source code of Morpharium publicly viewable for
educational transparency and official modding reference. Morpharium is
SOURCE-AVAILABLE software — it is NOT open-source software and is NOT open
for public code contributions.

===========================================================================
1. PERMITTED USES
===========================================================================

(a) Research and Education (Attribution Required)
    You may view, download, build locally, study, reference, and cite this
    source code strictly for non-commercial personal learning, academic
    research, or educational instruction, PROVIDED THAT:
    - You give clear, visible credit to "nopetrides" and "Morpharium"
      (including a link to the official repository or release); and
    - You do not distribute playable copies, builds, or re-packaged
      versions of the game.

(b) Modding Through Intended Channels
    You may inspect the game's gene schemas, pattern primitives, and
    modding interfaces in order to create and share original Gene Packs
    (JSON pack files and your own original artwork/grayscale pattern masks)
    exclusively through Morpharium's intended modding channels (such as the
    in-game Gene Pack loader / Gene Studio and the official Steam Workshop).
    You retain rights to your own original mod assets, subject to the terms
    of the distribution platform (e.g., Steam Subscriber Agreement).

